    "snippet": "| i Three Decades in the Long Grass The Story of Global Paciﬁc & Partners M É M O I R E S R E C O L L E C T I O N S R E F L E C T I O N S Duncan Clarke & Babette van Gessel ii | THREE DECADES IN THE LONG GRASS | iii Published by Global Paciﬁc & Partners  Private Edition: Édition Privé With special thanks to Tewodros Ashenaﬁ © Duncan Clarke and Babette van Gessel 2014 ISBN: 978-1-4314-0984-6 Design and layout by Jacana Media Printed by xxxxxxx Job no. 002098 I N M E M O R I A M Harry W. Wassall Founder & Chairman, Petroconsultants 1921–95 Conrad Gerber Founder & President, Petrologistics Co-Founder, African Institute of Petroleum 1941–2009 Alfred John Boulos Founder & Chairman, European Petroleum Negotiators Group 1930–2013 A N D D E D I C A T E D T O Christian Suter Former Chief Executive, Petroconsultants SA Tim Zoba Jr.\nSenior Partner, 1989–2003 Global Paciﬁc & Partners iv | THREE DECADES IN THE LONG GRASS CONTENTS | v Contents Prologue . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . vii Senior Partners 1978–2014 . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ix Milestones . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ."
  },
