    "snippet": "---\ntitle: The Boys' Band\ndate: 2016-01-07\n---\nThe Boys' Band is the currently untitled band formed by Luke and John. The band consists of Luke, John, Theo, and James, who is not part of the Lost & Found program but quit dancing so he could focus more on the band.\n\nHistory[]\n\nEarly Stages[]\n\nThe band was formed by Luke and John one night while they were together, spontaneously. James later joined when the band (Luke, Theo and John at that point, presumably) was in need of a drummer; they were rehearsing in a room (the Music Room) in The Next Step Dance Studio.[1]\n\nSeason 1[]\n\nThe band performs \"Lost and Found\" to several different people from in and outside of the studio.[1] In Talking Heads, Theo describes the band members are like his family.[1]\n\nMembers[]\n\nPerformances[]\n\n- \"Lost and Found\" (\"Lost and Found\")\n\n- \"Best Day\" (\"Play the Record\")\n\n- \"Heart Shape\" (\"Heart Shape\")\n\n- \"Thunder Keeps Roaming\" (\"Heart Shape\")\n\n- \"True Love\" (\"Callin' Callin' Part 1\")\n\n- \"Lost and Found\" (\"Callin' Callin' Part 2\")\n\nGallery[]\n\n| \"Okay, please show me.\"\n\nTo view the The Boys' Band gallery, click here. |\n\nReferences[]\n\n- ↑ 1.0 1.1 1.2 \"Lost and Found (episode).\" Wikia. Retrieved on January 7, 2016."
