in Transamerica. The latter role won her a Golden Globe Award, Independent Spirit Award, National Board of Review, and an Academy Award nomination for Best Actress.\n\nOn March 12, 2019, Huffman was arrested and charged with conspiracy to commit mail fraud and honest services mail fraud. She had been involved with a nationwide college entrance exam cheating scandal to help"
