    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Why did you become a math teacher?\ndate: 2025-06-06\n---\nWhy did you become a math teacher?\n\nHi I'm transferring to a university from a cc and applied for math major and got accepted (only need 2 more years to finish BS Math). However due to my math/science grades, the school is also offering me a spot in computer engineering and is strongly trying to convince me to go there (it would take me at least 3 years because my cc didn't offer engineering classes).\n\nI really, really like math and am thinking of becoming a math teacher/actuary, but with the school's offer, it's kind of tough not to turn down CE because of (hopefully high) pay.\n\nWhy did you choose to become a math teacher/professor? What is it like? What advice would you give to someone considering being a math teacher?\n\nthank you!"
