eaching in the background, and sometimes reading with her students,\" she continued. \"We learned together, and the ladies were so loving and affectionate. It was amazing to me that my mom did that and it sparked an interest in me.\"\n\nWith that background, it wasn't a surprise to her family when Topal chose to"
