    "snippet": "---\ntitle: High school teachers, have you sponsored travel abroad trips for your high school students?\ndate: 2025-06-09\n---\nHigh school teachers, have you sponsored travel abroad trips for your high school students?\n\nHi everyone,\n\nI just learned that a neighboring school district took a group of high school students to study abroad at the University of Salamanca in Spain. It got me wondering how many teachers get to travel abroad with their students. I think seeing the world should be a part of education, and I want to see if we can do something like that for our kids. But first, I want to ask y'all who has done it, where did you go, and how did you make it happen? Tips and advice welcomed.\n\nIf it's relevant, both my wife and I are young-ish teachers in Texas, working at the same campus, and we don't have children, so ideally we would both sponsor such a trip, along with the typical admins, of course.\n\nSo, where have you taken your students?"
