account of their romance, It Does Not Die is Devi's response. A counter to Eliade's fantasies, it is also a moving story of what happens to young love when enchantment and disillusion, cultural difference and colonial arrogance collide.\n\nI first saw a paperback version of Eliade's Bengal"
