 a fictional town named Peach Creek. They have a few friends in their neighborhood who also make regular appearances on the show.\n\nThey also have a rivalry with three girls known as the Kanker sisters, Mary, Lee, and May. Their various plans to con other people out of money often fail and leave them in really painful"
