irst episode is known far and wide as one of the most graphic, gory and plainly unsettling in all of mainstream anime. So far, only the thirteen-episode anime series has been licensed in the United States, by ADV Films, and in Australia, by Madman Entertainment. ADV Films stated that the series was one of their best-selling and \"most notorious"
