    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Episode 21\ndate: 2022-09-18\n---\nIt'll Just Be Our Secret (私と凪くんだけの秘密じゃん, Watashi to nagi-kun dake no himitsujan?) is the twenty-first episode of the A Couple of Cuckoos anime series.\n\nPlot[]\n\nAfter placing 1st in the school's year ranking, Nagi proposes to Hiro again, but once again, he's rejected, but she confesses that she wishes she was engaged to him. Nagi would later tell this to both Erika and Sachi, and Erika proposes a beach retreat to figure out what Hiro meant by her confession. Eventually, despite their hopes for her not to learn the fact, Hiro learns that both Nagi and Erika live together.\n\nSummary[]\n\nIn the classroom of his school, Nagi opens up his report card in front of the two class nerds, and they're amazed to learn that Nagi earned 1st place in the year ranking. On the other hand, Nagi already knew that he'd earn 1st place after placing 13th last month and was hoping he'd be praised as a Pheonix for his comeback. However, the response he receives from the two nerds is tepid as they're disappointed his feat isn't good rom-com material. The three boys who bet on him before also don't care about Nagi's year ranking placement, but Nagi is still satisfied with his it and vows not to allow Hiro to get first place again.\n\nAfterward, Nagi gets a note from Hiro asking him to meet her on the rooftop. Recalling Hiro's declaration that she wouldn't lose to him again, Nagi wonders if Hiro intends to do it again. If this were the case, Nagi wouldn't mind; however, he'd steel himself to do the same and ask her out on a date. Unbeknownst to Nagi, Shion was secretly eavesdropping on Nagi and was glad that Nagi was going to meet with Hiro and ask her out.\n\nOn the rooftop, Hiro sits on a bench and patiently waits for Nagi; once he arrives, Hiro congratulates Nagi for 1st place in the year ranking. She also compliments him as a phoenix for climbing his way from 13th place last time. Flustered, Nagi downplays it as from behind the doorway to the rooftop, Shion"
