    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Perfection\ndate: 2002-09-03\n---\nPerfection is the forty-sixth volume of the original Funimation Dragon Ball Z DVD and VHS releases. It includes three installments from the Perfect Cell Saga: episodes 144, 145, and 146.\n\nCover art[]\n\nThe cover art depicts Semi-Perfect Cell transforming into his Perfect form.\n\nEpisodes[]\n\n- The Last Defense - With the remote control smashed and Vegeta giving Cell the go-ahead, the stage is set for Cell's terrifying completion. Now it's up to Krillin and Trunks to save 18 from Cell's power-hungry grasp. But Vegeta isn't going to let Trunks ruin his plan! Will Trunks strike against own father to save the Earth from Cell?\n\n- Cell is Complete - Dr. Gero's dream has been realized, and the Earth's greatest fear has come true. Cell is complete! Can anyone stop the android nightmare in his final form? As the heroes nervously line up, a glimmer of hope shines from above. Gohan is a Super Saiyan!\n\n- Vegeta Must Pay - After allowing Cell to reach his final form, Vegeta is ready for the challenge he was promised. But as Cell becomes a brick wall to the Saiyan's every blow, it's clear that Vegeta has more than he bargained for!\n\nTrivia[]\n\n- The back cover mistakenly lists the original Japanese episode numbers 159, 160, and 161."
