    "score": 0.44789671897888184,
    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Taiyo Asano\ndate: 2021-01-01\n---\nTaiyo Asano (朝野 太陽, Asano Taiyō) is the main protagonist of Mission: Yozakura Family. He was originally a normal high schooler before marrying into the Yozakura Family and becoming a spy to protect Mutsumi and learn the truth behind the accident which claimed the lives of his family.\n\nHe later officially took the Yozakura name, once becoming a legal adult, now called Taiyo Yozakura (夜桜 太陽, Yozakura Taiyō).[4]\n\nAppearance[]\n\nTaiyo is a fair-skinned young man of average height with messy, medium-length scarlet-red hair that falls in front of his face in short bangs with one whirled strand that sticks out from the rest.\n\nHis eyes are scarlet-colored like his hair and he has a noticeable scar over his left eye, that he got from his family's accident.\n\nTaiyo is often seen wearing his navy blue high school uniform, but during his spy missions, he wears the Yozakura Family's Loungewear Suit which resembles a baggy black jumpsuit in appearance.\n\nAfter the 5-year timeskip, Taiyo now dresses in a black hooded overcoat and loungewear suit.\n\nPersonality[]\n\nOriginally, Taiyo was an outgoing and cheerful boy until he lost his entire family in a car accident. This incident caused him to undergo a dramatic personality shift, making him afraid of any emotional connections or even interact with anyone in fear he might lose them as well; the only person whom he remained close with being Mutsumi as she made a promise to never leave him.\n\nAfter marrying into the Yozakura family and going through so much with them, Taiyo slowly but surely begins to regain some of his former personality; becoming a far more open and sociable person.\n\nHowever, perhaps his most defining personality trait is his compassion, which is noted to be remarkable within the cutthroat world of espionage. Not only will Taiyo stubbornly refuse to kill any of his opponents, regardless of how evil they might be or if they goad him into crossing that line; even when pitted against a foe he truly despises, Taiyo still continues to utilize nonlethal force and will either try to restrain or incapacitate them to the best of his ability.\n\nTaiyo is also quite warm and generous to both friends and family"
  },
