or his discovery of the genetic principle for generation of antibody diversity\" | |\n| Frank Wilczek | Physics | 2004 | Physics | \"for the discovery of asymptotic freedom in the theory of the strong interaction\" | Also a MacArthur Fellow |\n\nEmeritus faculty\n\n**"
