1,500,000 boaters; and some of the largest railroad operators in Europe rely on Jeppesen. INFORMS first took notice of Jeppesen in 2000, when judges for the association's Franz Edelman Award competition gave the prize to Jeppesen after a turning point in the company's history. In 1997, Jeppesen saw"
