    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Ten Year Blogiversary\ndate: 2025-03-31\n---\nBefore March officially ends, I need to acknowledge this is the TEN YEAR anniversary of The Heart of a Book Blogger.\n\nAn entire decade of talking about books online.\n\nThere is so much I could (and should!) say, but honestly it's hard to wrap my head around this. I started this blog when I was in high school . . . and now I work at a publishing house!\n\nFrom making so many friends to attending amazing events and meeting favorite authors—what a wild ride this has been.\n\nAnd I am so thankful to everyone who has ever stopped by and followed me here (or over on bookstagram)—thank you, thank you, thank you for all the support and love over the years. You all are the very best!\n\nSo to celebrate this huge milestone, I'm bringing us back to why we're all here: the books. Read on for my favorite book of the year for each year I've been blogging. And let me know in the comments if we have any favorites in common—or what books you've read because of me!\n\n2024 – Love, Off the Record\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2023 – Stars and Smoke\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2022 – Book Lovers\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2021 – Firekeeper's Daughter\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2020 – Check, Please! Book 2\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2019 – We Are the Perfect Girl\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2018 – Save the Date\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2017 – Noteworthy\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2016 – Truthwitch\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\n2015 – The Wrath and the Dawn\n\nFind it: Goodreads, Bookshop, Barnes & Noble, Amazon\n\nCongratulations on 10 years!\n\nThank you, Sonya! <3"
