e are the only ones feeling that way. Then the Sandy Hook Elementary School shootings happened.[On December 14, 2012, in Newtown, Connecticut, when 20-year-old Adam Lanza fatally shot 20 children and 6 adult staff members at a school.]\n\nI felt compelled to share"
