us with Julie's Library, a new podcast where Andrews and Hamilton read some of the books they have co-authored. Originally scheduled for later this year, Andrews has, according to the website, \"accelerated the show's launch in order to bring it to audiences as soon as possible,\" with an exact date to be announced. Julie Andrews reading to you—talk about favorite things!\n\nNaughty Mabel Series by"
