rrifying it actually is until we are naked in public, at least emotionally.\n\nMy book, Love and Laughter: Sexy (Meaningful) Fun for Everyone! has been out for just over a year now, and sometimes I still have the urge to wrap my arms around myself to avoid being overwhelmed by the scrutiny I always feel. It's a bizarre feeling, but it's my truth. I feel completely exposed. Even beyond physically; my heart and"
