    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Inside Alicia Keys' Love Story with Her Husband and Life with Her Kids\nauthor: Grace Jidoun\ndate: 2023-07-18\n---\nInside Alicia Keys' Love Story with Her Husband and Life with Her Kids\n\nAlicia Keys and her husband, Swizz Beatz, had an unconventional start to their relationship.\n\nAlicia Keys is a talented multi-tasker. The singer-songwriter is the winner of 15 Grammys, the author of a best-selling memoir (More Myself), a devoted activist, and a former Coach on The Voice. Despite all she has going on, she is able to balance it all with her beautiful, blended family.\n\nHere's everything you need to know about Alicia Keys' husband and her kids.\n\nWho is Alicia Keys married to?\n\nKeys is married to hip-hop artist and music producer Swizz Beatz, whose real name is Kasseem Dean.\n\nThe rollercoaster romance started when Keys and Swizz Beatz were New York teens in the '90s. They met through a mutual high school friend when Keys (born Alicia Augello-Cook) was 14 and Beatz was 16 — though Keys was not interested in the rapper at first.\n\nRELATED: Every Winner of The Voice Through the Years\n\n\"He'd usually pull up in some fancy car, rolling deep with his Bronx crew and shining with diamonds. I wanted nothing to do with that scene or with Swizz,\" she wrote in her memoir.\n\nFor years, their mutual success landed them in the same music industry circles and at the same events. However, they didn't hit it off until the singer and music producer reconnected in 2008 on a project, and a friendship blossomed.\n\n\"The more we talked the more I noticed how his mind worked. Beyond the baggy jeans and arm tats there was depth. He was so aware of what was happening in the world,\" she wrote about her future husband.\n\nWhen did Alicia Keys and Swizz Beatz get married?\n\nTheir friendship quickly turned into a whirlwind romance, and they quietly dated for nearly two years before Beatz proposed to the singer. The engagement announcement in May 2010 