ater founded several climate technology companies, was named a Breakthrough Energy Fellow. It is a program of Breakthrough Energy, a network founded by Bill Gates that aims to accelerate innovation in sustainable energy and in other technologies to reduce greenhouse gas emissions.\n\nPresident Joe Biden nominated Julie Turner M.P.M. '03 as special envoy on North"
