 this multigenerational network of activists dismantling structural racism by using your power to take action on the most pressing issues of our time.\n\nJoin NAACP todayWe tackle today's toughest challenges\n\nNAACP is leading the fight for justice\n\nEnsure that Black America continues to thrive\n\nThis year will be pivotal. When it comes to civil rights and social justice, we have the unique ability to secure more wins than anyone else. The issues that affect our community will make or break how we continue to thrive in this country. Together, let's amplify the voice of Black America to make sure solutions to our most pressing issues are equitable"
