ok Prize. He has also written on the complex dynamics of the American experience including the New York Times bestseller, \"Begin Again: James Baldwin's America and Its Urgent Lessons for Our Own,\" and his most recent book, \"We Are the Leaders We Have Been Looking For,\" which through a meditative approach, astutely examines how people can move away from a reliance on politicians shaping their lives to take on"
